L4-E13 (MESHSAT-1357): U-03, A PANEL WHOSE OPEN-CIRCUIT VOLTAGE IS BOUNDED AT THE COLDEST OPERATING TEMPERATURE INSIDE
REQ-016'S WINDOW, BY ITS MAKER'S DOCUMENT OR BY A CONTROLLED UNIT (PANEL-ACC). Prototype design, desk arithmetic: nothing
bought, built, powered or measured; no physical unit is accepted.

